DevOps Made Simple: Step-by-Step Guide


1️⃣ Git – Version Control System

What it does: Git helps developers manage and store their code in one place. It also tracks changes made by the team.

When it’s used: The starting point. Developers write, save, and push their code to Git.


2️⃣ Jenkins – Continuous Integration/Delivery (CI/CD)

What it does: Jenkins automates building and testing the code to ensure everything works properly.

When it’s used: After code is pushed to Git, Jenkins builds and tests it.


3️⃣ Docker – Containerization

What it does: Packages the application and dependencies into a container so it runs anywhere.

When it’s used: After Jenkins confirms the code works, Docker creates the container.


4️⃣ Trivy – Security Scanning

What it does: Scans Docker containers for security issues.

When it’s used: After the container is created, Trivy ensures it’s secure.


5️⃣ Kubernetes (K8s) – Orchestration

What it does: Manages containers, ensuring scalability and availability.

When it’s used: After security checks, Kubernetes handles deployment.


6️⃣ ArgoCD – GitOps Deployment

What it does: Automates deployments by applying Git configurations to Kubernetes.

When it’s used: Keeps Kubernetes deployments updated automatically.


7️⃣ Ansible – Configuration Management

What it does: Configures and manages infrastructure like Kubernetes clusters or servers.

When it’s used: After deployment, ensures infrastructure is properly configured.


8️⃣ Prometheus & Grafana – Monitoring and Alerts

What they do: Prometheus monitors health metrics, while Grafana visualizes data. Both send alerts for issues.

When they’re used: Continuously monitor performance after deployment.



💡 The Real Impact

Faster Deployments: Automate builds, tests, and deployments to cut delivery time by up to 50%.

Fewer Bugs: Catch vulnerabilities early with Trivy and CI/CD pipelines.

Scalable Systems: Kubernetes handles traffic scaling automatically.

Improved Security: Trivy and Ansible ensure secure, compliant systems.

Real-Time Monitoring: Prometheus and Grafana offer insights and fast issue resolution.
